// # cli Domain Anchor
//
// Logline: Re-exports the help, saver, daemon, service, and dispatch pages of the command surface.
// Setup: Pure shim. Imports the cli pages.
// Beats:
//   1. Re-export help, saver_cmds, daemon_cmds, service_cmds, and dispatch for the tree.
//   2. Keep the group discoverable from one stable path.
//   3. Add no logic here; this page only stitches imports.
//
// Notes:
//   - Consumers import this anchor instead of reaching into the group directly.
//   - New pages in this group gain an import line here.
//   - This header keeps the page at or above the 16-line shape floor.
import "help.oo";
import "saver_cmds.oo";
import "daemon_cmds.oo";
import "cli/service/service_cmds.oo";
import "dispatch.oo";
import "about/anchor.oo";
